1
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:04,160
I'm Peppa Pig.

2
00:00:04,160 --> 00:00:05,279
[OINKS]

3
00:00:05,279 --> 00:00:08,039
This is my little brother
George.

4
00:00:08,039 --> 00:00:10,520
This is mummy Pig.

5
00:00:10,520 --> 00:00:11,959
And this is daddy Pig.

6
00:00:11,959 --> 00:00:13,360
[OINKS]
[LAUGHTER]

7
00:00:14,559 --> 00:00:15,959
Peppa Pig. Oink.

8
00:00:20,640 --> 00:00:24,000
[PEPPA READING
ONSCREEN TEXT]

9
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:27,040
NARRATOR:
Today is Mummy Pig's birthday.

10
00:00:27,040 --> 00:00:29,880
Daddy Pig has made Mummy Pig
breakfast in bed.

11
00:00:29,880 --> 00:00:32,439
Happy birthday Mummy Pig!
Oink!

12
00:00:32,439 --> 00:00:35,760
Peppa and George have made
Mummy Pig a birthday card.

13
00:00:35,760 --> 00:00:37,080
Happy Birthday Mummy!

14
00:00:37,080 --> 00:00:38,280
Oink! Oink!

15
00:00:38,280 --> 00:00:41,480
Oh! What a lovely
birthday surprise!

16
00:00:41,480 --> 00:00:43,680
And there are more
surprises to come!

17
00:00:43,680 --> 00:00:45,440
Enjoy your
birthday breakfast!

18
00:00:45,440 --> 00:00:47,000
Take your time.

19
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:49,480
[GIGGLING]

20
00:00:49,480 --> 00:00:51,559
Mmm! Yummy!

21
00:00:51,559 --> 00:00:52,919
[CHILDREN LAUGHING]

22
00:00:52,919 --> 00:00:54,599
Quick! We have to get
everything else ready!

23
00:00:54,599 --> 00:00:58,040
Daddy Pig has made
a birthday cake for Mummy Pig.

24
00:00:58,040 --> 00:01:00,440
Oink! We've just got
to put the candles on!

25
00:01:00,440 --> 00:01:01,559
[GIGGLING]

26
00:01:01,559 --> 00:01:03,800
One.. Two...

27
00:01:03,800 --> 00:01:05,200
Here I come!

28
00:01:05,200 --> 00:01:07,840
Mummy Pig has finished
her birthday breakfast.

29
00:01:07,840 --> 00:01:09,200
Mummy's coming!

30
00:01:09,200 --> 00:01:12,200
Oh no!
We're not ready yet!

31
00:01:12,200 --> 00:01:13,200
[KNOCKING]

32
00:01:13,200 --> 00:01:14,920
Uh, who is it?

33
00:01:14,920 --> 00:01:16,840
It's Mummy.
Can I come in?

34
00:01:16,840 --> 00:01:18,759
No! No! Oink!

35
00:01:18,759 --> 00:01:20,440
Is there something
secret going on?

36
00:01:20,440 --> 00:01:22,960
Er, no, nothing's going on.
Oink!

37
00:01:22,960 --> 00:01:23,960
But you can't come in.

38
00:01:23,960 --> 00:01:25,119
Oink! I see.

39
00:01:25,119 --> 00:01:26,560
[GIGGLE]

40
00:01:26,560 --> 00:01:29,520
Mummy Pig. Why don't you
relax in the sitting room?

41
00:01:29,520 --> 00:01:32,399
That's sounds nice.
Well, it is your birthday!

42
00:01:32,399 --> 00:01:34,600
Oink! Okay, Peppa.

43
00:01:34,600 --> 00:01:37,039
I think I know where
the sitting room is!

44
00:01:37,039 --> 00:01:38,039
[LAUGHS]

45
00:01:38,039 --> 00:01:39,560
Oink! Here's a nice magazine.

46
00:01:39,560 --> 00:01:40,679
Thank you, Peppa.

47
00:01:40,679 --> 00:01:41,839
And here's some pretty music.

48
00:01:41,839 --> 00:01:43,399
[CLASSICAL MUSIC PLAYING
OVER RADIO]

49
00:01:43,399 --> 00:01:44,440
Thank you, Peppa.

50
00:01:44,440 --> 00:01:46,399
[GIGGLES]

51
00:01:46,399 --> 00:01:48,000
[GIGGLING]

52
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:52,199
Oink! We need the same number
of candles as Mummy's age.

53
00:01:52,199 --> 00:01:55,080
One... two... three...

54
00:01:55,080 --> 00:01:56,360
Oh dear.

55
00:01:56,360 --> 00:01:58,440
We haven't got
nearly enough candles.

56
00:01:58,440 --> 00:02:01,479
Daddy? How old is Mummy?

57
00:02:01,479 --> 00:02:03,919
I'll whisper it in your ear.

58
00:02:03,919 --> 00:02:05,679
[WHISPERING]

59
00:02:05,679 --> 00:02:08,320
Wow! Really old! 

60
00:02:08,320 --> 00:02:09,799
[LAUGHS]

61
00:02:09,799 --> 00:02:12,359
Oink! You know, I think
three candles will be fine.

62
00:02:12,359 --> 00:02:15,000
Mummy Pig's
birthday cake is ready!

63
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:16,480
Hurrah

64
00:02:16,480 --> 00:02:17,760
[LAUGHTER]

65
00:02:17,760 --> 00:02:18,880
We just have to put up

66
00:02:18,880 --> 00:02:20,359
the decorations
in the sitting room.

67
00:02:20,359 --> 00:02:22,440
[YAWNS]

68
00:02:23,720 --> 00:02:24,959
Hello Mummy!

69
00:02:24,959 --> 00:02:26,359
Ah, there you all are!

70
00:02:26,359 --> 00:02:28,280
I was getting a little bored.

71
00:02:28,280 --> 00:02:29,799
Mummy? Would you like to have

72
00:02:29,799 --> 00:02:31,560
a nice walk in the garden?

73
00:02:31,560 --> 00:02:32,760
[LAUGHS]

74
00:02:32,760 --> 00:02:34,160
Oink! Do I have any choice?

75
00:02:34,160 --> 00:02:35,160
Nope!

76
00:02:35,160 --> 00:02:36,560
[LAUGHS]

77
00:02:36,560 --> 00:02:37,519
Bye, bye Mummy!

78
00:02:37,519 --> 00:02:39,320
Have a lovely walk! Oink!

79
00:02:39,320 --> 00:02:43,160
We'll call you when it's safe
to come back in.

80
00:02:43,160 --> 00:02:45,120
I'd forgotten what hard work
birthdays were!

81
00:02:45,120 --> 00:02:46,320
[LAUGHS]

82
00:02:46,320 --> 00:02:47,959
[LAUGHING]

83
00:02:47,959 --> 00:02:50,400
Daddy Pig, Peppa and George are
decorating the sitting room.

84
00:02:50,400 --> 00:02:53,040
[LAUGHS]

85
00:02:55,560 --> 00:02:59,280
[LAUGHS]

86
00:03:00,040 --> 00:03:01,359
[CAR HONKS]

87
00:03:01,359 --> 00:03:03,679
Granny and Grandpa Pig
have arrived

88
00:03:03,679 --> 00:03:05,959
for Mummy Pig's birthday.

89
00:03:05,959 --> 00:03:09,079
Oink!
Happy Birthday Mummy Pig!

90
00:03:09,079 --> 00:03:11,239
Aren't you coming inside?

91
00:03:11,239 --> 00:03:12,519
Oh, I can't come in yet.

92
00:03:12,519 --> 00:03:13,880
Daddy Pig, Peppa and George

93
00:03:13,880 --> 00:03:16,239
are doing secret things
for my birthday.

94
00:03:16,239 --> 00:03:18,040
How lovely! Oink!

95
00:03:18,040 --> 00:03:19,359
See you later!

96
00:03:19,359 --> 00:03:20,920
Bye!

97
00:03:21,840 --> 00:03:23,079
[LAUGHS]

98
00:03:23,079 --> 00:03:25,519
Mummy, would you like
to come inside now?

99
00:03:25,519 --> 00:03:26,959
I'd love to.

100
00:03:26,959 --> 00:03:28,679
Close your eyes!

101
00:03:32,079 --> 00:03:34,519
Keep your eyes closed Mummy!

102
00:03:34,519 --> 00:03:36,040
[LAUGHS]

103
00:03:36,040 --> 00:03:38,959
DADDY:
One... two... three...

104
00:03:38,959 --> 00:03:40,119
Open your eyes!

105
00:03:40,119 --> 00:03:41,200
[PARTY HORNS]

106
00:03:41,200 --> 00:03:43,280
Happy Birthday Mummy Pig!

107
00:03:43,280 --> 00:03:47,079
[LAUGHING AND OINKING]

108
00:03:47,079 --> 00:03:49,200
Blow the candles out... Oink!

109
00:03:49,200 --> 00:03:51,399
And make a wish!

110
00:03:51,399 --> 00:03:52,440
[LAUGHS]

111
00:03:52,440 --> 00:03:55,760
Mummy, Mummy!
Open your present!

112
00:03:55,760 --> 00:03:58,480
Oink! I've no idea!

113
00:03:58,480 --> 00:03:59,920
Open it and see.

114
00:04:02,920 --> 00:04:05,959
It's a beautiful dress!

115
00:04:07,760 --> 00:04:09,280
[GASPS]

116
00:04:09,280 --> 00:04:10,920
You're beautiful, Mummy.

117
00:04:10,920 --> 00:04:12,440
Oink, oink!

118
00:04:12,440 --> 00:04:15,359
Now you just need
somewhere nice to wear it.

119
00:04:15,359 --> 00:04:16,519
What's this?

120
00:04:16,519 --> 00:04:18,000
Two tickets
to the theatre!

121
00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:20,079
Tonight! Oink!

122
00:04:20,079 --> 00:04:21,719
Thank you! Oink!

123
00:04:21,719 --> 00:04:24,120
Mummy Pig loves going
to the theatre.

124
00:04:24,120 --> 00:04:28,680
And Granny Pig and I are going
to babysit the little ones.

125
00:04:28,680 --> 00:04:30,800
Hurrah!

126
00:04:30,800 --> 00:04:33,280
What a super birthday!

127
00:04:33,280 --> 00:04:37,159
I'm the luckiest Mummy
in the whole world! Oink!

128
00:04:37,159 --> 00:04:40,080
And the most beautiful!

129
00:04:40,080 --> 00:04:43,159
[LAUGHTER]

130
00:04:51,640 --> 00:04:54,400
[PEPPA READING
ONSCREEN TEXT]

131
00:04:58,560 --> 00:05:00,039
NARRATOR:
Peppa and George are having

132
00:05:00,039 --> 00:05:03,360
their favourite food:
spaghetti!

133
00:05:06,520 --> 00:05:08,120
[OINKS,
THEN LAUGHS]

134
00:05:08,120 --> 00:05:11,039
What a lot of noise!

135
00:05:11,039 --> 00:05:12,440
Oink! Finished!

136
00:05:12,440 --> 00:05:13,560
Oink! Oink!

137
00:05:13,560 --> 00:05:16,159
Ah, now we'll have
a bit of quiet!

138
00:05:16,159 --> 00:05:18,400
[LAUGHS]

139
00:05:21,039 --> 00:05:23,039
Oink! What's that?

140
00:05:23,039 --> 00:05:24,320
It's a tooth!

141
00:05:24,320 --> 00:05:26,360
Where did that come from?

142
00:05:26,360 --> 00:05:27,680
[LAUGHS]

143
00:05:27,680 --> 00:05:29,400
Peppa, maybe you should
look in the mirror!

144
00:05:29,400 --> 00:05:30,440
Oink!
Oink!

145
00:05:30,440 --> 00:05:31,520
[LAUGHING]

146
00:05:33,200 --> 00:05:34,280
Oh!

147
00:05:34,280 --> 00:05:35,840
[LAUGHTER]

148
00:05:35,840 --> 00:05:38,640
It's my tooth! Oink!

149
00:05:38,640 --> 00:05:40,159
It's fallen out!

150
00:05:40,159 --> 00:05:41,640
MUMMY:
Don't worry Peppa.

151
00:05:41,640 --> 00:05:44,719
It's just a milk tooth.
They're meant to fall out.

152
00:05:44,719 --> 00:05:47,000
Will I grow a new one, Mummy?

153
00:05:47,000 --> 00:05:49,320
MUMMY:
Yes you will Peppa.

154
00:05:49,320 --> 00:05:52,200
It also means the Tooth Fairy
will be paying you a visit.

155
00:05:52,200 --> 00:05:54,000
Tooth Fairy?

156
00:05:54,000 --> 00:05:56,240
Yes, the Tooth Fairy.

157
00:05:56,240 --> 00:05:58,919
If you put the tooth under
your pillow tonight,

158
00:05:58,919 --> 00:06:01,240
the Tooth Fairy will come.

159
00:06:04,080 --> 00:06:06,000
Oink! Oink!

160
00:06:06,000 --> 00:06:08,159
The Tooth Fairy
will take the tooth.

161
00:06:08,159 --> 00:06:12,120
And in it's place,
she will leave a shiny coin!

162
00:06:12,120 --> 00:06:14,640
Oink! Oink!

163
00:06:14,640 --> 00:06:17,760
Oink! When I grow up,
I want to be a Tooth Fairy!

164
00:06:17,760 --> 00:06:19,359
[LAUGHS]

165
00:06:19,359 --> 00:06:20,479
Oink! And what would you like

166
00:06:20,479 --> 00:06:22,599
to be when you grow up, George?

167
00:06:22,599 --> 00:06:24,120
Dine-Saw!

168
00:06:24,120 --> 00:06:25,200
[LAUGHS]

169
00:06:25,200 --> 00:06:26,280
A dinosaur!

170
00:06:26,280 --> 00:06:27,680
[LAUGHTER]

171
00:06:27,680 --> 00:06:30,240
Quick George,
it's bedtime!

172
00:06:30,240 --> 00:06:32,680
Oink! We don't want
to miss the Tooth Fairy!

173
00:06:34,240 --> 00:06:38,039
Before going to bed, Peppa and
George brush their teeth.

174
00:06:39,520 --> 00:06:41,560
Peppa, what are you doing?

175
00:06:41,560 --> 00:06:43,120
Oink! I'm brushing my tooth

176
00:06:43,120 --> 00:06:46,000
so it's nice and clean
for the Tooth Fairy.

177
00:06:46,000 --> 00:06:48,400
[LAUGHTER]

178
00:06:48,400 --> 00:06:50,840
Peppa cannot wait
to get into bed.

179
00:06:50,840 --> 00:06:53,320
Peppa is putting her tooth
under the pillow

180
00:06:53,320 --> 00:06:54,760
for the Tooth Fairy.

181
00:06:54,760 --> 00:06:56,919
Goodnight Peppa and George.
Oink!

182
00:06:56,919 --> 00:06:59,359
[LAUGHS,
THEN OINKS]

183
00:06:59,359 --> 00:07:00,520
[LAUGHS]

184
00:07:00,520 --> 00:07:01,479
Goodnight Mummy!

185
00:07:01,479 --> 00:07:03,599
Oink! Goodnight Daddy!

186
00:07:03,599 --> 00:07:06,400
Oink!
Goodnight my little piggies!

187
00:07:08,400 --> 00:07:09,680
[DOOR CLOSES]

188
00:07:09,680 --> 00:07:10,840
[LAUGHS]

189
00:07:10,840 --> 00:07:13,479
George,
I'm not going to sleep! Oink!

190
00:07:13,479 --> 00:07:17,200
Lets both stay awake all night
and see the Tooth Fairy!

191
00:07:17,200 --> 00:07:18,159
Oink!

192
00:07:18,159 --> 00:07:20,359
[LAUGHTER]

193
00:07:20,359 --> 00:07:21,440
Oink!

194
00:07:24,440 --> 00:07:27,400
Oink!
This Tooth Fairy is very late!

195
00:07:28,120 --> 00:07:29,560
[SIGHS]

196
00:07:29,560 --> 00:07:33,840
The Tooth Fairy is taking
a long time to arrive.

197
00:07:33,840 --> 00:07:35,960
Where is that Tooth Fairy?

198
00:07:35,960 --> 00:07:38,080
[SNORING]

199
00:07:38,080 --> 00:07:39,960
What is that noise?

200
00:07:39,960 --> 00:07:41,479
Is it the Tooth Fairy?

201
00:07:41,479 --> 00:07:45,400
George, can you hear something?

202
00:07:45,400 --> 00:07:46,479
[SNORING]

203
00:07:46,479 --> 00:07:47,960
Oh, George!

204
00:07:47,960 --> 00:07:49,799
Oh, the noise is George.

205
00:07:49,799 --> 00:07:52,760
He was so tired,
he has fallen asleep.

206
00:07:54,239 --> 00:07:59,640
George is not very good
at staying awake but I am.

207
00:07:59,640 --> 00:08:03,719
I've got to stay awake
and see the Tooth Fairy.

208
00:08:03,719 --> 00:08:06,799
I'm not going to sleep.

209
00:08:06,799 --> 00:08:09,880
[SNORING]

210
00:08:11,919 --> 00:08:13,880
The Tooth Fairy has arrived.

211
00:08:14,400 --> 00:08:15,640
Oink! Oink!

212
00:08:15,640 --> 00:08:17,760
But Peppa is asleep.

213
00:08:17,760 --> 00:08:19,359
[MUMMY PIG'S VOICE]
Hello Peppa.

214
00:08:19,359 --> 00:08:22,479
Would you like this coin
in return for your tooth?

215
00:08:22,479 --> 00:08:24,840
[SNORES]

216
00:08:26,880 --> 00:08:28,799
What a nice clean tooth.

217
00:08:28,799 --> 00:08:31,719
Thank you, Peppa.
Goodnight.

218
00:08:38,280 --> 00:08:39,959
Peppa, George, wake up.

219
00:08:39,959 --> 00:08:41,319
It's morning.

220
00:08:41,319 --> 00:08:44,360
What?
I wasn't asleep!

221
00:08:44,360 --> 00:08:46,280
Did the Tooth Fairy come?

222
00:08:46,280 --> 00:08:47,800
No.

223
00:08:47,800 --> 00:08:50,199
Let's take a look
under your pillow.

224
00:08:51,920 --> 00:08:53,319
Look, Peppa!

225
00:08:53,319 --> 00:08:56,840
The Tooth Fairy has been
and she's left you a coin!

226
00:08:56,840 --> 00:08:58,319
Hooray!

227
00:08:58,319 --> 00:09:00,240
[LAUGHS]

228
00:09:00,240 --> 00:09:02,840
You fell asleep, didn't you?

229
00:09:02,840 --> 00:09:06,400
Well, maybe I fell asleep
just for a little bit. Oink!

230
00:09:06,400 --> 00:09:11,840
Next time I will stay awake
and I will see the Tooth Fairy!

231
00:09:11,840 --> 00:09:16,959
[LAUGHTER]

232
00:09:22,760 --> 00:09:25,240
[PEPPA READING
ONSCREEN TEXT]

233
00:09:25,240 --> 00:09:26,920
[LAUGHTER]

234
00:09:29,439 --> 00:09:31,000
NARRATOR:
Today, Peppa and her family

235
00:09:31,000 --> 00:09:33,720
are going for a drive
in their red car.

236
00:09:33,720 --> 00:09:35,880
Oink! Shall we have
the roof down?

237
00:09:35,880 --> 00:09:37,120
Yes, please!

238
00:09:37,120 --> 00:09:38,240
Oink! Oink!

239
00:09:39,720 --> 00:09:41,480
[LAUGHTER]

240
00:09:41,480 --> 00:09:43,400
Peppa and George
love their car.

241
00:09:43,400 --> 00:09:45,120
Is everybody ready?

242
00:09:45,120 --> 00:09:46,319
Ready!

243
00:09:46,319 --> 00:09:48,600
Then let's go!

244
00:09:48,600 --> 00:09:50,400
[CAR HONKS]

245
00:09:54,640 --> 00:09:56,360
Oink! I love our car!

246
00:09:56,360 --> 00:09:57,520
[LAUGHS]

247
00:09:57,520 --> 00:09:59,880
And our car loves us too!
Don't you?

248
00:09:59,880 --> 00:10:01,000
[CAR HONKS]

249
00:10:01,000 --> 00:10:02,560
[LAUGHTER]

250
00:10:04,600 --> 00:10:07,040
[ENGINE MAKING STRANGE NOISES]

251
00:10:07,040 --> 00:10:10,880
Oh dear, the car does
not sound very well.

252
00:10:15,040 --> 00:10:16,360
Oink! What's wrong Daddy?

253
00:10:16,360 --> 00:10:18,920
Hm!
Uh, I don't know.

254
00:10:18,920 --> 00:10:21,839
Oink! Let's take it
to Granddad Dog's Garage.

255
00:10:21,839 --> 00:10:23,040
He can fix it.

256
00:10:23,040 --> 00:10:25,199
That's a good idea,
Mummy Pig. Oink!

257
00:10:28,439 --> 00:10:29,720
Woof!

258
00:10:29,720 --> 00:10:31,560
Granddad Dog
runs the garage.

259
00:10:31,560 --> 00:10:33,839
He is very good
at mending cars.

260
00:10:33,839 --> 00:10:36,800
[CAR HONKS]

261
00:10:36,800 --> 00:10:37,839
Woof!

262
00:10:37,839 --> 00:10:39,760
Oh dear, Daddy Pig!

263
00:10:39,760 --> 00:10:41,839
Your car does not
sound very well.

264
00:10:41,839 --> 00:10:43,040
[CAR MAKES STRANGE NOISE]

265
00:10:43,040 --> 00:10:45,400
Can you fix it please,
Granddad Dog?

266
00:10:45,400 --> 00:10:46,439
Yes...

267
00:10:46,439 --> 00:10:49,439
but it will take all day.

268
00:10:49,439 --> 00:10:50,800
Oh...

269
00:10:50,800 --> 00:10:53,439
Oink! We wanted to go
for a drive in our car.

270
00:10:53,439 --> 00:10:55,079
Woof!
Don't worry.

271
00:10:55,079 --> 00:10:57,600
You can borrow this new car
while I fix yours.

272
00:10:57,600 --> 00:10:59,000
Hurrah!

273
00:10:59,000 --> 00:11:00,000
[LAUGHTER]

274
00:11:00,000 --> 00:11:01,000
Thank you, Granddad Dog.

275
00:11:01,000 --> 00:11:02,240
Would you like the roof down?

276
00:11:02,240 --> 00:11:04,160
Oink! Yes, please!

277
00:11:04,160 --> 00:11:07,280
I'll just press
this red button.

278
00:11:08,560 --> 00:11:10,160
What a clever car!

279
00:11:10,160 --> 00:11:11,600
[GASPING]

280
00:11:11,600 --> 00:11:15,000
Woof! When you come back
I will have fixed your car.

281
00:11:15,000 --> 00:11:17,000
Thank you,
Grandad Dog.

282
00:11:17,000 --> 00:11:18,079
Oink! Goodbye.

283
00:11:18,079 --> 00:11:19,079
Goodbye.
Bye-bye.

284
00:11:19,079 --> 00:11:20,240
Oink! Oink!

285
00:11:20,240 --> 00:11:22,199
Goodbye!

286
00:11:23,719 --> 00:11:27,000
Peppa and her family
like the new blue car.

287
00:11:27,000 --> 00:11:29,439
There are so many buttons
in this new car.

288
00:11:29,439 --> 00:11:32,680
PEPPA:
Oink! What does
the green button do, Daddy?

289
00:11:32,680 --> 00:11:34,199
Let's see.

290
00:11:35,120 --> 00:11:37,640
Magic windows!

291
00:11:37,640 --> 00:11:39,600
[LAUGHTER]

292
00:11:39,600 --> 00:11:42,600
Daddy! Make the magic windows
go down.

293
00:11:44,160 --> 00:11:45,760
[LAUGHTER]

294
00:11:45,760 --> 00:11:48,079
Oink! What does
the blue button do?

295
00:11:48,079 --> 00:11:51,079
I don't know.
Let's see.

296
00:11:52,199 --> 00:11:54,480
[LOUD ROCK MUSIC
PLAYING OVER SPEAKERS]

297
00:11:54,480 --> 00:11:56,280
Ah!

298
00:11:56,280 --> 00:11:59,199
[LAUGHTER]

299
00:11:59,199 --> 00:12:00,800
Oink! I love this new car.

300
00:12:00,800 --> 00:12:02,400
Can we keep it?

301
00:12:02,400 --> 00:12:04,480
No, we can't keep it, Peppa.

302
00:12:04,480 --> 00:12:06,680
We've only borrowed
it for today.

303
00:12:06,680 --> 00:12:07,839
[BOTH GROAN]

304
00:12:07,839 --> 00:12:09,280
[DISTANT THUNDER]

305
00:12:09,280 --> 00:12:11,560
Oh no, I think
it's going to rain.

306
00:12:11,560 --> 00:12:15,680
Yes, I'll just put
the roof up. Oink!

307
00:12:15,680 --> 00:12:19,160
Now, which is the button
to close the roof?

308
00:12:19,160 --> 00:12:20,800
[CAR HONKS]

309
00:12:20,800 --> 00:12:21,800
[LAUGHTER]

310
00:12:21,800 --> 00:12:24,160
Oops! Silly Me.

311
00:12:24,160 --> 00:12:27,120
Ah ha, this must
be the button.

312
00:12:27,760 --> 00:12:29,240
Argh!

313
00:12:29,240 --> 00:12:32,240
The new car has squirted
Daddy Pig with water.

314
00:12:32,240 --> 00:12:33,360
[LAUGHTER]

315
00:12:33,360 --> 00:12:34,880
Silly Daddy,
that's not the roof!

316
00:12:34,880 --> 00:12:36,199
This button!

317
00:12:36,199 --> 00:12:37,160
Oops! Not that one.

318
00:12:37,160 --> 00:12:38,360
This button!

319
00:12:38,360 --> 00:12:40,160
[LOUD ROCK MUSIC
PLAYING OVER SPEAKERS]

320
00:12:40,160 --> 00:12:41,160
[CAR ALARM SOUNDING]

321
00:12:41,160 --> 00:12:42,760
Help!

322
00:12:42,760 --> 00:12:46,160
Daddy Pig has forgotten
which button closes the roof.

323
00:12:46,160 --> 00:12:48,439
I don't think this car likes me!

324
00:12:48,439 --> 00:12:50,800
Let's try the red button.

325
00:12:50,800 --> 00:12:51,880
[ALARM STOPS]

326
00:12:51,880 --> 00:12:53,400
Hurray!

327
00:12:53,400 --> 00:12:56,079
[LAUGHTER]

328
00:12:56,079 --> 00:12:58,160
But now
it's stopped raining.

329
00:12:58,160 --> 00:13:00,520
Oink! Can we
open the roof again?

330
00:13:00,520 --> 00:13:02,240
Er, yes.

331
00:13:02,240 --> 00:13:03,719
Which button was it?

332
00:13:03,719 --> 00:13:06,599
The red one!

333
00:13:06,599 --> 00:13:08,160
Hurray!

334
00:13:08,160 --> 00:13:09,480
[LAUGHTER]

335
00:13:09,480 --> 00:13:10,560
[CAR HORN HONKS]

336
00:13:10,560 --> 00:13:15,560
Granddad Dog has fixed the car.

337
00:13:15,560 --> 00:13:17,680
Your car is fixed. Woof!

338
00:13:17,680 --> 00:13:19,120
Hurray!

339
00:13:19,120 --> 00:13:22,199
Thank you Granddad Dog,
and keep the change.

340
00:13:22,199 --> 00:13:23,800
Thank you,
Daddy Pig.

341
00:13:23,800 --> 00:13:25,599
Woof! Woof! Goodbye!

342
00:13:25,599 --> 00:13:26,680
Oink! Goodbye.

343
00:13:26,680 --> 00:13:27,680
Goodbye.

344
00:13:27,680 --> 00:13:29,839
Bye-bye.
Oink! Oink!

345
00:13:31,760 --> 00:13:34,920
Ah! It's good to get
our old car back again! Oink!

346
00:13:34,920 --> 00:13:38,920
I liked the new car,
but I like our old car better.

347
00:13:38,920 --> 00:13:41,480
And I think our old car
likes us too.

348
00:13:41,480 --> 00:13:42,640
Don't you?

349
00:13:42,640 --> 00:13:43,680
[CAR HONKS]

350
00:13:43,680 --> 00:13:46,520
[LAUGHTER]

351
00:13:53,760 --> 00:13:56,959
[PEPPA READING
ONSCREEN TEXT]

352
00:13:56,959 --> 00:13:58,839
NARRATOR:
Granny and Grandpa Pig
are making

353
00:13:58,839 --> 00:14:01,520
a treasure hunt
for Peppa and George.

354
00:14:01,520 --> 00:14:04,120
Granny Pig is drawing
the treasure map.

355
00:14:06,400 --> 00:14:08,120
Grandpa Pig
is burying the treasure

356
00:14:08,120 --> 00:14:11,040
in a secret place
in the garden.

357
00:14:11,040 --> 00:14:12,520
Grandpa Pig!

358
00:14:12,520 --> 00:14:14,280
Have you finished?!

359
00:14:14,280 --> 00:14:16,439
Peppa and George
will be here soon!

360
00:14:16,439 --> 00:14:17,560
[LAUGHS]

361
00:14:17,560 --> 00:14:21,800
Oink! No need to panic,
Granny Pig!

362
00:14:21,800 --> 00:14:23,160
Peppa and her family are here!

363
00:14:23,160 --> 00:14:26,520
Quick Grandpa Pig!
They're here!

364
00:14:26,520 --> 00:14:28,800
Almost done!

365
00:14:28,800 --> 00:14:31,360
[LAUGHTER]

366
00:14:31,360 --> 00:14:32,560
[SIGHS]

367
00:14:32,560 --> 00:14:35,640
Grandpa Pig
just finished in time!

368
00:14:35,640 --> 00:14:36,839
Granny Pig! Oink!

369
00:14:36,839 --> 00:14:37,920
We're here!

370
00:14:37,920 --> 00:14:39,040
Grunt! Ganggy Ig!

371
00:14:39,040 --> 00:14:41,640
Oink!
Hello my little ones!

372
00:14:41,640 --> 00:14:43,120
Grandpa Pig!

373
00:14:43,120 --> 00:14:44,079
Baba Ig!

374
00:14:44,079 --> 00:14:47,199
Ahoy there,
me hearties!

375
00:14:47,199 --> 00:14:51,199
Peppa, George, we've made
you a treasure hunt!

376
00:14:51,199 --> 00:14:55,560
Oink! Somewhere in the garden
is buried treasure!

377
00:14:55,560 --> 00:14:58,160
Wow! Treasure!

378
00:14:58,160 --> 00:15:00,560
Oink! Where is it?

379
00:15:00,560 --> 00:15:02,640
You have to look for it.

380
00:15:02,640 --> 00:15:05,280
Here's a treasure map
for Peppa.

381
00:15:05,280 --> 00:15:08,400
And George can
wear my pirate hat.

382
00:15:08,400 --> 00:15:11,280
Ahoy there,
Captain George!

383
00:15:11,280 --> 00:15:13,000
[OINKS,
THEN LAUGHS]

384
00:15:13,000 --> 00:15:16,719
Oink!
The map is a bit difficult.

385
00:15:16,719 --> 00:15:18,439
Daddy can you help?

386
00:15:18,439 --> 00:15:21,640
Of course Peppa.
I'm very good with maps.

387
00:15:21,640 --> 00:15:24,839
Er. It is a bit difficult.

388
00:15:24,839 --> 00:15:29,199
Daddy Pig, you're holding
the map upside down!

389
00:15:29,199 --> 00:15:32,240
Yes, I thought as much. Oink!

390
00:15:32,240 --> 00:15:34,319
PEPPA:
It's easy!

391
00:15:34,319 --> 00:15:37,319
The red cross shows
where the treasure is!

392
00:15:37,319 --> 00:15:41,360
DADDY:
But where in the garden
are those two apple trees?

393
00:15:41,360 --> 00:15:43,520
Hmm, I don't know.

394
00:15:43,520 --> 00:15:45,000
Would you like a clue?

395
00:15:45,000 --> 00:15:46,959
Yes please!
Oink!

396
00:15:46,959 --> 00:15:49,479
The first clue
is in a bottle.

397
00:15:49,479 --> 00:15:52,000
Oink!
But where is the bottle?

398
00:15:52,000 --> 00:15:54,599
Oink! I can see it!

399
00:15:54,599 --> 00:15:57,599
[LAUGHTER]

400
00:15:58,920 --> 00:16:01,000
Peppa has found
the first clue.

401
00:16:01,000 --> 00:16:02,640
A message in a bottle.

402
00:16:02,640 --> 00:16:05,120
Oink! Look everyone!
Here's the bottle!

403
00:16:05,120 --> 00:16:06,160
Oink! Oink!

404
00:16:06,160 --> 00:16:07,560
Well done, Peppa! Oink!

405
00:16:07,560 --> 00:16:09,640
Let's see what
the message says.

406
00:16:09,640 --> 00:16:13,359
Oh, it's a message
from a pirate!

407
00:16:13,359 --> 00:16:17,359
Mummy? Can you read
the pirate's message?

408
00:16:17,359 --> 00:16:21,640
Hmm. This pirate
has very bad handwriting...

409
00:16:21,640 --> 00:16:24,479
The pirate's handwriting
is excellent.

410
00:16:24,479 --> 00:16:26,959
No, I can't
make it out at all.

411
00:16:26,959 --> 00:16:30,400
The pirate has clearly written,
“Follow the arrows!”

412
00:16:30,400 --> 00:16:32,240
Follow the arrows?

413
00:16:32,240 --> 00:16:33,479
Oink! Oink!

414
00:16:33,479 --> 00:16:36,000
George has found
the second clue!

415
00:16:36,000 --> 00:16:38,160
Sticks in the shape
of an arrow!

416
00:16:38,160 --> 00:16:39,920
Look! They point this way!

417
00:16:39,920 --> 00:16:41,400
[LAUGHING]

418
00:16:41,400 --> 00:16:44,680
Peppa and George
are following the arrows.

419
00:16:47,479 --> 00:16:48,880
PEPPA:
Look George! A key!

420
00:16:48,880 --> 00:16:51,839
Peppa has found the next clue.
A key!

421
00:16:51,839 --> 00:16:53,959
Well done, Peppa!
Oink!

422
00:16:53,959 --> 00:16:55,959
Now you just have to find

423
00:16:55,959 --> 00:16:58,680
the treasure chest
that it unlocks.

424
00:16:58,680 --> 00:17:01,680
But there aren't
any more clues.

425
00:17:01,680 --> 00:17:04,720
Maybe you should take another
look at the map...

426
00:17:04,720 --> 00:17:08,440
Look Peppa, the map
has two apple trees on it.

427
00:17:09,680 --> 00:17:11,639
Here's an apple tree! Oink!

428
00:17:11,639 --> 00:17:13,159
And here's an apple tree!

429
00:17:13,159 --> 00:17:14,480
Oink! Oink!

430
00:17:14,480 --> 00:17:18,159
So the treasure must be here!

431
00:17:18,159 --> 00:17:19,839
Let's take a look!

432
00:17:21,359 --> 00:17:25,040
[GRUNTING]

433
00:17:25,040 --> 00:17:28,639
Oh dear. There doesn't seem to
be anything here...

434
00:17:29,879 --> 00:17:31,040
[HOLLOW THUDS]

435
00:17:31,040 --> 00:17:32,080
Hang on!

436
00:17:32,080 --> 00:17:33,480
There is something here!

437
00:17:33,480 --> 00:17:35,960
Wow! Treasure!

438
00:17:35,960 --> 00:17:37,040
ALL:
Hurray!

439
00:17:37,040 --> 00:17:37,960
[LAUGHTER]

440
00:17:37,960 --> 00:17:39,040
Well done,
well done.

441
00:17:39,040 --> 00:17:40,040
[LAUGHTER]

442
00:17:40,040 --> 00:17:41,560
I've got the key to open it!

443
00:17:43,600 --> 00:17:45,480
Wow! I can't believe it!

444
00:17:45,480 --> 00:17:47,480
Gold coins!

445
00:17:47,480 --> 00:17:49,480
They must be worth a fortune!

446
00:17:49,480 --> 00:17:51,440
It's better than that!

447
00:17:51,440 --> 00:17:56,680
They are not gold coins,
they are chocolate coins!

448
00:17:56,680 --> 00:17:59,879
And there's a chocolate coin
for everybody.

449
00:17:59,879 --> 00:18:00,919
ALL:
Hurray!

450
00:18:00,919 --> 00:18:02,280
[LAUGHTER] 

451
00:18:02,280 --> 00:18:04,560
Peppa and George
love chocolate coins.

452
00:18:04,560 --> 00:18:07,040
Everyone loves
chocolate coins.

453
00:18:07,040 --> 00:18:09,040
Granny, Grandpa.

454
00:18:09,040 --> 00:18:11,960
This is the best
treasure hunt ever!

455
00:18:11,960 --> 00:18:16,240
[LAUGHTER]

456
00:18:19,760 --> 00:18:21,080
[♪♪♪]

457
00:18:21,080 --> 00:18:22,200
[GIGGLING]

458
00:18:22,200 --> 00:18:23,879
PEPPA:
♪ Peppa Pig ♪

459
00:18:23,879 --> 00:18:26,840
[SNORTING, GIGGLING]

460
00:18:26,840 --> 00:18:28,720
♪ Peppa Pig ♪

461
00:18:28,720 --> 00:18:31,080
[SNORTING, GIGGLING]

462
00:18:31,080 --> 00:18:32,919
♪ Peppa Pig ♪

463
00:18:32,919 --> 00:18:34,720
[GRUNTING]

